  "summary": "Endorsed as a read-only design report. It accurately captures the owner's intent to keep stacks and mixes on each target and reward the player for switching across enemies, including after a one-shot kill. SchoolStates rejects dead targets and resolves heat and cold during application, supporting the proposed use of confirmed hits for switch history and pre-hit states for reactions. The report accurately qualifies Hemorath's Pressure feed and identifies the effects of raising caps on finishers, sync, Rime slowdown, and visuals. Implementation readiness remains open pending concrete Edacious and Phantasmal payoffs, their precedence with existing finishers and conduction, and explicit cap and threshold rules. No runtime validation was performed."
